# What main.py, config.py and models.py import, and the server that runs them. requirements.txt pins these and
# everything they need, and is generated from this file with pip-compile (see deployment.md, "Updating dependencies").
firebase-admin
Flask
Flask-SocketIO
# Serves the app in the Docker image, with a thread per connection (Flask-SocketIO's threading mode).
gunicorn
# Gives threading mode its WebSocket transport. python-engineio requires it too, but without it the sockets would
# silently fall back to long-polling, so it's listed on purpose.
simple-websocket
